WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:02.836
Is this the end of a cycle?

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:05.088
We still have a good team,

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:06.464
but to be honest we lost everything.

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:09.050
It’s impossible to see Real Madrid

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:10.552
winning the Champions League.

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:14.472
The path to a 14th title has never been steeper.

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:25.567
Many doubted it, but not this coach

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:26.776
not these players

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:28.570
and definitely not these fans.

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:38.079
This is no ordinary club.

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:38.913
This is

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:39.622
Real Madrid.

